 items enter the UI (`ContentFilters`), never per row, and an empty provider list means the built-in order with everything on — which is why the last enabled provider cannot be switched off.\n\n### Fixed\n- [DE] **The artist page gets its content rows and the description.** `ArtistPage.description` was parsed but never drawn, so a language of artist information that the mobile app shows simply did not exist here.\n\n### Commits\n- v6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.3: port the mobile Content screen\n---\nThis release was built automatically from commit `7494fbbf27ad7f8cbb18c0108cee958390d7211a`.\n"},{"tag_name":"6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-alpha","name":"Vivi Music 6.0.6.5_DE 1.53.2","published_at":"2026-09-21T17:12:21Z","prerelease":true,"draft":false,"html_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/tag/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-alpha","assets":[{"name":"innosetup.log","size":49089,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-alpha/innosetup.log"},{"name":"INSTALL-GUIDE.md","size":10167,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-alpha/INSTALL-GUIDE.md"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-arm64.dmg","size":153132671,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-alpha/VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-arm64.dmg"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-arm64.pkg","size":147962581,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-alpha/VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-arm64.pkg"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-AUR.tar.gz","size":1526,"download_count":0,"browser_download_url":"https://github.com/PiBOH/vivi-music-de/releases/download/6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-alpha/VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-AUR.tar.gz"},{"name":"VIVIMusic-6.0.6.5_DE-1.53.2-setup.exe","size":130668561,"download_count":1,"browser_download_url":"https://github